/-!
Bounded Boolean checks of literal word equalities.
The range lemmas assemble checked blocks without repeating their reductions.

Source: the pinned ATLAS G23G1-P1 cyclic trace in
`Certificates/source/Pool.json`; see its accompanying README.
Generated by `PoolWords/source/Generate.py`. All computations are checked
by the ordinary Lean kernel.
